			<div class="content" id="post-content-1696786">
									

<p>There's a joke, often attributed to Groucho Marx, but apparently it's not actually his.</p>
<p>Outside of a dog, a book can be your best friend.</p>
<p><em>Inside</em> of a dog, it's too dark to read.</p>
<p>So I started thinking&#8230; what if that were not the case? What if, inside of a dog, there was a tastefully-furnished, well-lit reading room?</p>
<p>And once I had that utterly ludicrous idea, I decided to see where it could go if I played it completely seriously.</p>

